<title>AUSTRALIA: ICI open to single bids for ICI stake.</title>
<headline>ICI open to single bids for ICI stake.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Imperial Chemical Industries Plc on Monday said it was open to bids for its entire 62.4 percent stake in Australian subsidiary ICI Australia Ltd.</p>
<p>Announcing details of the public offering of most of its 185 million shares, ICI Plc said it would consider a bid for the entire shareholding.</p>
<p>&quot;We have kept an open mind should anyone wish to come alone as part of this offering...,&quot; ICI Plc's group strategic planning manager, Robert Milligan, told a news conference in Melbourne.</p>
</text>
